WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.536
Choose a use case. The preview and complete recipe describe the same output.

00:00:10.536 --> 00:00:16.895
Open the example in the workbench. Editing stays silent.

00:00:16.895 --> 00:00:21.422
Open DevTools → Console. Test in console prints exactly one entry.

00:00:21.422 --> 00:00:25.452
Copy complete JavaScript. It runs without installing ConsoleFX.

00:00:25.452 --> 00:00:29.040
Browse by purpose or style. Every example uses the same editor.

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:36.111
Confirm the replacement. Your previous work remains in Undo.

00:00:36.111 --> 00:00:40.166
Supply your own facts. Named fields keep the card's layout intact.

00:00:40.166 --> 00:00:44.686
Copy the updated output. Drafts stay in this browser; editing and copying stay silent.
